Did you know we have a year-round floating saunas and cold plunge on the Columbia River in Portland, Oregon? 

 @Ebb & Ember Floating Sauna is Portland's first ever floating sauna experience, and it is open year-round. Located over at the Elevated Tides Marina off NE Bridgeton Road and Marine Drive, this Nordic-inspired sanctuary sits right on the Columbia River. You can book the entire space as a private group for up to 10 people, or sign up for a solo social session to kick back and meet some new friends. Cycle between the deep cedar heat and an intense cold plunge straight into the river, or use their outdoor deck shower setup if you want to ease into the chill.

